@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Workshop Operations — Check-in, Adjustment and Settlement
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Staff / Consultant|
:Locate confirmed Booking using code / QR;
:Check in customer and verify actual product participants;
if (Each unbooked extra person actually contributes?) then (yes)
  :Prepare adjustment = 100,000 VND x each extra contributing person;
  :Record adjustment reason, Staff actor and time;
  |Guest or Member|
  :Review and consent to adjustment;
  |System|
  :Append InvoiceAdjustment to invoice audit trail;
else (no)
endif
|Staff / Consultant|
if (Waiver or changed fee requested?) then (yes)
  |Owner / Manager|
  :Approve or reject waiver/change;
  |Staff / Consultant|
  :Record Owner decision and reason in audit trail;
else (no)
endif
|System|
:Calculate final balance = unpaid 50% package amount + approved adjustments;
|Guest or Member|
:Settle final balance at shop by cash or bank transfer;
|Staff / Consultant|
:Record settlement transaction and fulfilment state;
|System|
:Keep invoice/payment audit history;

note right
The fee is not based only on a person being present. It applies only when an unbooked additional person actually participates in making the product.
end note
stop
@enduml
